..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : ATLASAUSFUHR.AUSFUHR
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Funktion       : Auswahl der Version zur Erstellung der ABAS-ATLAS-IHSS-Datei
.. Functionality  : Chose Version for creation of ABAS-ATLAS IHSS file.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. ensure atlasparam field is defined
.type text   xtatihssversion         ? _F|defined(T|xtatihssversion)
..
..
.. pick abas atlas ihss version
.. ----------- ----- IHSS Version ----------- ----------------------------------
.continue IHSS1   ?  T|xtatihssversion = "1"
.continue IHSS2   ?  T|xtatihssversion = "2"
.. ----------- ---------- ---------- -------------------------------------------
.. use customized, if not set
.continue STD
..
..
!IHSS1
.input "atlas/ATLASAUSFUHR.IHSS1"
.continue END
..
!IHSS2
.input "atlas/ATLASAUSFUHR.IHSS2"
.continue END
..
!STD
.input "atlas/ATLASAUSFUHR.STD"
.continue END
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
